# The complete configuration surface of the application.
#
# Every variable the code reads is listed here with a description and a safe
# local default. A variable that is not in this file does not exist as far as
# the project is concerned. Copy to `.env` for local development; real values
# never enter the repository (see docs/local-development.md).
#
# Variables are added in the same pull request as the code that first reads
# them. None are read yet.
